  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square oil painting of pastel houses with chimneys, a blue spiky creature, and a green vehicle with eye like wheels, signed crump 11.",
    "description": "A square oil painting on wood, signed crump 11 at lower right. Rounded houses with stacked chimney caps in teal, purple, pink and red stand on a grey ground under a pale yellow and lilac sky. A blue creature with a spiky back and a hooded face sits among them at centre. In the foreground a lime green vehicle with two eye like wheels, a tail and furry tan feet lies on the ground, with a small pink spiky creature at right. Thick black outlines, flat colour, visible brush texture.",
    "impression": "A small town where the vehicles are animals and the houses wear hats. The green vehicle in front looks like a sleepy caterpillar waiting for its driver. Quiet and friendly, like a village from a picture book.",
